            <p>Martial. 1, 85, 5. 6 confert O. Crusius Philol. XLVI 615.</p>
          </note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="30" xml:id="kock-0404-adelon_dramaton-30" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0404_adelon_dramaton">
          <note type="source">
            <p>1. 2. [Lucianus] Amor. 27 <foreign xml:lang="grc">ἡ θήλεια τέρψις ὅλῃ μοίρᾳ πλεονεκτεῖ τὴν ἄρρενα.</foreign> — 9. <foreign xml:lang="grc">ὡσεὶ προσῆκον δ᾽ οὐδὲν</foreign> Kaibel.</p>
          </note>
          <note type="apparatus">
            <p>10. multo minus quam ulla mearum coniectura admitti potest K. Zacheri (Berl. Wochenschr. 712) <foreign xml:lang="grc">ἔκρουσε πουλύπουν τιν'· ὁ δὲ πρίασθαι θέλων.</foreign>
            </p>
          </note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="37" xml:id="kock-0404-adelon_dramaton-37" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0404_adelon_dramaton">
          <note type="apparatus">
            <p>4 <foreign xml:lang="grc">τὸν λῆρον</foreign> (i. e. 'cerebri ex vino perturbationem'), <foreign xml:lang="grc">ὥστε τὰς ῥ. λῆρον δοκεῖν</foreign> Madvig. Advers. crit. III 52. <foreign xml:lang="grc">τὸν οἶνον ὥστε τ. ῥ. λῆρον δοκεῖν</foreign> Kaibel.</p>
          </note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="42" xml:id="kock-0404-adelon_dramaton-42" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0404_adelon_dramaton">
